        <p class="facing__role">The building</p>
        <h2 class="facing__name">Plain on purpose</h2>
        <p>Built in 1841 by people who had been meeting in a barn, and extended twice since without ever becoming beautiful. There is no stained glass and there never was — clear windows, whitewash, and a gallery on three sides.</p>
        <p>The baptistry is under the floor at the front. Most visitors do not notice it until somebody lifts the boards.</p>
